# Every script here runs on the Linux host, never on whatever machine edited
# it. A CRLF shebang line is a silent "bad interpreter" failure at exec time,
# not a diff-noise annoyance -- force LF regardless of any given clone's own
# core.autocrlf setting.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
Makefile text eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
